// File:    std/sets.skink
// Purpose: Mutable generic set type plus set-algebra operations that the
//          built-in immutable set<T> literal type does not provide:
//          union, intersection, difference, symmetric difference,
//          subset/superset/disjoint/equality predicates, and conversion
//          from native set<T> literals.
// Author:  Mark Oxley
// Created: 2026
